  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop on Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA), Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CERF budget facilitates a NCEA three-day workshop on Strategic Environmental Assessment (SEA), specifically targeting the Colombian public sector. All participants play a key role in the development and/or implementation of the Marine Spatial Plan. The ultimate goal is to enhance knowledge and build capacity in strategic environmental assessment, stakeholder participation, SEA governance and SEA scoping. Marine spatial planning will be used as a practical example of how strategic environmental assessment can be applied.</narrative>
  </description>
